# two-step
@length 1bar

1.1      [kick hat-closed]  1/16  v110
1.1.3    hat-closed  1/16  v70
1.2      [snare hat-closed]  1/16  v100
1.2.3    hat-closed  1/16  v70
1.3.2    kick  1/16  v95
1.3.3    hat-closed  1/16  v70
1.4      [snare hat-closed]  1/16  v100
1.4.3    snare 1/16  v28  # ghost
1.4.4    hat-open  1/16  v80
